sequenceDiagram
    participant LLM as LLM verdict — reasoning.json
    participant IDX as index.mjs
    participant M as model.mjs — validateRebalanceProposal
    participant SA as StrategyAgent
    participant SC as StrategyController
    participant PP as TranchePipeModule
    participant V as External venue — USDC/NVDA pool

    LLM-->>IDX: action buy / sell / hold + sizeUsd, hash-bound and capped in age
    IDX->>M: validate rails
    M->>M: oracle must be valid
    M->>M: buys require escrowFunded — RebalanceNotFunded otherwise
    M->>M: post-trade equityBps ≤ hardMaxEquityBps — default 75% — EquityCapExceeded otherwise
    M->>M: size clamped to min/max and remaining cap room
    M->>M: verdict age and snapshot hash must match
    M-->>IDX: clamped proposal or rejection
    IDX->>SA: submitRebalance(equityOut, amountIn, minOut, deadline)
    SA->>SC: forward
    SC->>SC: per-call cap maxRebalanceSwapUsdc + cooldown
    SC->>PP: rebalanceSwap(...)
    PP->>PP: minOut must beat oracle − maxRebalanceSlippageBps — SlippageBoundUnmet otherwise
    PP->>V: router swap
    V-->>PP: output tokens
    PP-->>IDX: composition refreshed — assetComposition()
    Note over IDX,LLM: no fresh verdict ⇒ no trade — the params path still runs
    Note over PP: venue is configured with setRebalanceVenue — never the hook ERC-7575 JIT pool
